{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50748","headline":"秋日宿简寂观陆先生草堂 · 张祜","name":"秋日宿简寂观陆先生草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫霄峯下草堂仙，千载空梁石磬悬。\n白气夜生龙在水，碧云秋断鹤归天。\n竹廊影过中庭月，松槛声来半壁泉。\n明日又爲浮世恨，满山行路梦依然。\n（见《吉石庵丛书》本陈舜俞《庐山记》卷四，题作《简寂观》，「空梁」作「空遗」，「竹廊」作「空遗」，「竹廊」作「竹房」，「銮过」作「影占」，「行路」作「徒积」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}